ering +8</a>:</b> +8 <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical Resistance Rating</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shield_Bashing\" title=\"Shield Bashing\"> Shield Bashing +22%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shield_Bashing\" title=\"Shield Bashing\"> Shield Bashing +22%</a>:</b> +22% Enhancement bonus to your chance of a Secondary Shield Bash. This stacks with bonuses granted by any relevant feats.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Feat\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>: <a href=\"/page/Elusive_Target\" title=\"Elusive Target\">Elusive Target</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Feat\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>: <a href=\"/page/Elusive_Target\" title=\"Elusive Target\">Elusive Target</a></b>: Each time you would be physically damaged, you have a +5% chance to completely ignore the damage. (This applies to physical attacks and spells that deal physical damage.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Incite\" title=\"Incite\">Insightful  Incite +57</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeo